  "description": "Add a splash of fun and flavor to your designs with this vibrant watercolor cocktails clipart set! This collection features 49 hand-painted cocktail PNGs including margaritas, mojitos, martinis, champagne, wine, and more — perfect for summer party invites, bar menus, bachelorette party decor, and wedding designs.\nEach drink is painted with artistic detail to bring life and personality to your project, whether you’re creating printable art, digital planners, or branding for your beverage business.\n✨ WHAT’S INCLUDED\n49 high-resolution PNG files (transparent background).\n300 DPI, ideal for printing & digital use.\nHand-painted in watercolor style.\nVariety of alcoholic drinks: martinis, margaritas, mojitos, wine, champagne, cocktails, and more.\n🎨 PERFECT FOR\nParty clipart & summer invitations.\nCocktail clipart for menus & signage.\nWedding stationery & decor.\nBachelorette party graphics.\nScrapbooking, planners, and social media.\nDrink illustrations for branding or packaging.\n💡 USES\nWhether you’re designing for a summer party, bar-themed project, or a stylish drink menu, these cocktail clip arts are perfect for elevating your work. From drink illustrations to beverage clipart for weddings or events, this set covers all your creative needs.",
